      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在她身旁跑着，能把握她的呼吸和动作。\n比在远处看着，能更细致地掌握她的身体状况\n――我是这么考虑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fad28eb921c97e1fa6a788d4c1664cfe71eb27d97bbc06a9669caaa4622ff7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
